# ==========================================
# ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION

# ----- AUTHENTICATION -----
# If your environment already provides ANTHROPIC_API_KEY and ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL,
# you do not need to add them here.
#
# Otherwise, uncomment and fill in:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-your-key-here
# ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=your-base-url-here

# Required for all environments — copy .env.example to .env:
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929
